Package: landisR
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Forest Succession and Model Coupling Framework
Version: 0.1.0.9002
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Yan", family = "Boulanger", email = "yan.boulanger@rncan-nrcan.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6181-8509")),
    person(given = "Natural Resources Canada", role = "cph"))
Description: A spatial forest succession framework implemented in R and Rcpp. Its first validated growth engine closely follows the living-biomass dynamics of LANDIS-II
    Biomass Succession 5.2 while providing an interactive timestep-based interface for coupling succession with external disturbance, management, climate, ecological,
    and other models. The architecture supports direct state and input updates, integration with existing R tools, and future additional growth engines and model
    extensions.
